<view class="pageDemo"><mx-nav title="吸底输入框" /><view style="height:{{navHeight}}px;"></view><view class="demoIntro"><desc type="name" text="FootInput">FootInput</desc><desc>常用于浮动输入的场景，比如评论、回复等。</desc></view><wrap><title type="h2">是否显示</title><desc type="prop" text="visible">visible</desc><mx-foot-input visible="{{visible}}" bind:foot_input_done="handleChange" bind:foot_input_close="handleClose" /><view class="cons"><mx-btn width="120rpx" small bind:btn_tap="handleVisible">查看</mx-btn></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">值</title><desc type="prop" text="value">value</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">占位文本</title><desc type="prop" text="placeholder">placeholder</desc><desc type="value" text="占位文本">占位文本</desc><desc type="prop" text="placeholderColor">placeholderColor</desc><desc type="value" text="占位文本颜色">占位文本颜色</desc><mx-foot-input visible="{{visiblePlaceholder}}" placeholder="请输入内容..." placeholderColor="#1677FF" bind:foot_input_done="handleChange" bind:foot_input_close="handleClose" /><view class="cons"><mx-btn width="220rpx" small bind:btn_tap="handleVisiblePlaceholder">自定义占位文本</mx-btn></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">光标颜色</title><desc type="prop" text="cursorColor">cursorColor</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">背景色</title><desc type="prop" text="bgColor">bgColor</desc><desc type="value" text="背景色">背景色</desc><desc type="prop" text="inputBgColor">inputBgColor</desc><desc type="value" text="输入框背景色">输入框背景色</desc><mx-foot-input visible="{{visibleBg}}" bgColor="#FFFFFF" inputBgColor="#dae6f7" bind:foot_input_done="handleChange" bind:foot_input_close="handleClose" /><view class="cons"><mx-btn width="220rpx" small bind:btn_tap="handleVisibleBg">自定义背景色</mx-btn></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">按钮</title><desc type="prop" text="btnType">btnType</desc><desc type="value" text="按钮类型，primary / default / ghost">按钮类型，primary / default / ghost</desc><desc type="prop" text="btnText">btnText</desc><desc type="value" text="按钮文案">按钮文案</desc><desc type="prop" text="btnColor">btnColor</desc><desc type="value" text="按钮颜色">按钮颜色</desc><desc type="prop" text="btnWidth">btnWidth</desc><desc type="value" text="按钮宽度">按钮宽度</desc><mx-foot-input visible="{{visibleBtn}}" btnType="default" btnText="确定" btnColor="#1677FF" btnWidth="120rpx" bind:foot_input_done="handleChange" bind:foot_input_close="handleClose" /><view class="cons"><mx-btn width="180rpx" small bind:btn_tap="handleVisibleBtn">自定义按钮</mx-btn></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">层级</title><desc type="prop" text="zIndex">zIndex</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">点击蒙层是否可以关闭弹窗</title><desc type="prop" text="isCloseMask">isCloseMask</desc><mx-foot-input visible="{{visibleMask}}" isCloseMask="{{false}}" bind:foot_input_done="handleChange" bind:foot_input_close="handleClose" /><view class="cons"><mx-btn width="200rpx" small bind:btn_tap="handleVisibleMask">蒙层不可关闭</mx-btn></view></wrap><line /><prop-table dataSource="{{propDocs}}" /></view>